{"parse":{"title":"\"I Must See the Snow Swan's Unseen Dream for Myself, She Thought\"","pageid":477589,"revid":2189481,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">&#34;I Must See the Snow Swan&#39;s Unseen Dream for Myself, She Thought&#34;</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/8/87/Constellation_I_Must_See_the_Snow_Swan%27s_Unseen_Dream_for_Myself%2C_She_Thought.png/revision/latest?cb=20260812034059\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Constellation &quot;I Must See the Snow Swan&#39;s Unseen Dream for Myself, She Thought&quot;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/8/87/Constellation_I_Must_See_the_Snow_Swan%27s_Unseen_Dream_for_Myself%2C_She_Thought.png/revision/latest?cb=20260812034059\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/8/87/Constellation_I_Must_See_the_Snow_Swan%27s_Unseen_Dream_for_Myself%2C_She_Thought.png/revision/latest?cb=20260812034059 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/8/87/Constellation_I_Must_See_the_Snow_Swan%27s_Unseen_Dream_for_Myself%2C_She_Thought.png/revision/latest?cb=20260812034059 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Constellation &quot;I Must See the Snow Swan&#39;s Unseen Dream for Myself, She Thought&quot;\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" data-image-key=\"Constellation_%22I_Must_See_the_Snow_Swan%27s_Unseen_Dream_for_Myself%2C_She_Thought%22.png\" data-image-name=\"Constellation &quot;I Must See the Snow Swan&#39;s Unseen Dream for Myself, She Thought&quot;.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"character\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Char­ac­ter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Odette\" title=\"Odette\">Odette</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"level\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">Next</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\"><a href=\"/wiki/%22On_This_Danceless_Morn,_She_Gazes_at_Her_Reflection%22\" title=\"&quot;On This Danceless Morn, She Gazes at Her Reflection&quot;\">\"On This Danceless Morn, She Gazes at Her Reflection\"</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\"><a href=\"/wiki/%22I%27ll_Chase_the_Shouting_Wind_Along,_Climbing_Alone_As_I_Go%22\" title=\"&quot;I&#39;ll Chase the Shouting Wind Along, Climbing Alone As I Go&quot;\">\"I'll Chase the Shouting Wind Along, Climbing Alone As I Go\"</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDescription\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDetails\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"description\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">The Passive Talent \"Spring Rite of the Chosen One\" is enhanced as follows: every stack of <span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper giw-extra-effect-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-default mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed giw-extra-effect toggle-tooltip\">Marvelous Splendor</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content giw-extra-effect\" style=\"display:none\"><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-header\">Marvelous Splendor</span><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-content\">After unlocking the Ascension Talent \"Spring Rite of the Chosen One,\" Odette will obtain a special effect when she summons her Solo Dance Double.<br />Every stack of Marvelous Splendor active increases the character's Stellar Glimmer DMG by 15%. This lasts until her Dance Double exits the field or when she summons her Solo Dance Double again.<br />When Odette is off-field, she loses 1 stack of Marvelous Splendor every second, while other nearby party members gain the corresponding number of Marvelous Splendor stacks at the same time.</span></span></span> active also increases the character's ATK by 7%.<br />Additionally, if Odette is in the <span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper giw-extra-effect-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-default mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed giw-extra-effect toggle-tooltip\">Radiance: Stellar Glimmer</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content giw-extra-effect\" style=\"display:none\"><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-header\">Radiance: Stellar Glimmer</span><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-content\">Radiance: Stellar-Conduct and Radiance: Stellar Swirl are both considered Radiance: Stellar Glimmer states.<br />Characters can only be affected by one Radiance state at any one time, and where more than one state can be triggered, Radiance: Stellar-Conduct shall apply first.</span></span></span> state when there is a <span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper giw-extra-effect-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-default mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed giw-extra-effect toggle-tooltip\">Solo Dance Double</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content giw-extra-effect\" style=\"display:none\"><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-header\">Solo Dance Double</span><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-content\">A psychic double of Odette's that dances a duet with her. May be summoned to the field through her Elemental Skill or Elemental Burst.<br />Alternates between the Plume and Wing dance moves to periodically attack nearby opponents, dealing <span class=\"text-cryo\"><b>AoE Cryo DMG</b></span>.<br />A maximum of one Solo Dance Double summoned by Odette is allowed on the field at any one time.<br /><br />Additionally, when there is a Dance Double summoned by Odette nearby, her Elemental Skill Adagio: Phantom Night Dancers is changed to the special Elemental Skill Adagio: Coda at Dawn's Tolling.</span></span></span> on the field, opponents near the Dance Double will also have their corresponding Elemental RES lowered by 20%.<ul><li><b>Radiance: Stellar-Conduct</b>: <span class=\"text-cryo\"><b>Cryo</b></span> and <span class=\"text-electro\"><b>Electro</b></span>.</li><li><b>Radiance: Stellar Swirl</b>: <span class=\"text-cryo\"><b>Cryo</b></span> and <span class=\"text-anemo\"><b>Anemo</b></span>.</li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"utility1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Utility</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Cryo_RES_Reduction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cryo RES Reduction\">Cryo RES Reduction</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Electro_RES_Reduction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Electro RES Reduction\">Electro RES Reduction</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Anemo_RES_Reduction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Anemo RES Reduction\">Anemo RES Reduction</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/ATK_Increase\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"ATK Increase\">ATK Increase</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>\"I Must See the Snow Swan's Unseen Dream for Myself, She Thought\"</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Odette\" title=\"Odette\">Odette</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/Level_2_Constellation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Level 2 Constellation\">Level 2 Constellation</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2F%2522I_Must_See_the_Snow_Swan%2527s_Unseen_Dream_for_Myself%2C_She_Thought%2522%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table\">\n<tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th><th>Literal Meaning</th></tr><tr><td><b>English</b></td><td>\"I Must See the Snow Swan's Unseen Dream for Myself, She Thought\"</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Simplified)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hans\">「她想，我要见证雪鹄未见之梦」</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">\"Tā Xiǎng, Wǒ Yào Jiànzhèng Xuěhú Wèi Jiàn zhī Mèng\"</span></i></small></td><td rowspan=\"2\">\"She Thought, I Want to Witness the Dream that the Snow Swan Has Not Seen\"</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Traditional)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「她想，我要見證雪鵠未見之夢」</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">\"Tā Xiǎng, Wǒ Yào Jiànzhèng Xuěhú Wèi Jiàn zhī Mèng\"</span></i></small></td></tr><tr><td><b>Japanese</b></td><td><span lang=\"ja\">「雪鳥の見ぬ夢を只</span> <span lang=\"ja\">見届けたいだけで」</span><br /><small><i>\"Yukidori no Minu Yume wo Tada Mitodoketai Dake de\"</i></small></td><td>\"Only Wanting to See the Dream that the Snow Swan Did Not See With My Own Eyes\"</td></tr><tr><td><b>Korean</b></td><td><span lang=\"ko\">「검은</span> <span lang=\"ko\">백조의</span> <span lang=\"ko\">못다</span> <span lang=\"ko\">한</span> <span lang=\"ko\">꿈을</span> <span lang=\"ko\">품은</span> <span lang=\"ko\">채」</span><br /><small><i>\"Geomeun Baekjoui Motda Han Kkumeul Pumeun Chae\"</i></small></td><td>\"Harbouring the Unfinished Dream of the Black Swan\"</td></tr><tr><td><b>Spanish</b></td><td><span lang=\"es\">“</span>Quiero ver los sue<span lang=\"es\">ñ</span>os nunca vistos por el cisne n<span lang=\"es\">í</span>veo<span lang=\"es\">”</span></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>French</b></td><td><span lang=\"fr\">«</span>&#160;Je dois voir de mes yeux le r<span lang=\"fr\">ê</span>ve du cygne des neiges, pensa-t-elle&#160;<span lang=\"fr\">»</span></td><td>\"I Must See the Snow Swan's Dream With My Own Eyes, She Thought\"</td></tr><tr><td><b>Russian</b></td><td><span lang=\"ru\">«Она</span> <span lang=\"ru\">захотела</span> <span lang=\"ru\">увидеть</span> <span lang=\"ru\">сон</span>, <span lang=\"ru\">невиданный</span> <span lang=\"ru\">снежным</span> <span lang=\"ru\">лебедем»</span><br /><small><i>\"Ona zakhotela uvidet' son, nevidannyy snezhnym lebedem\"</i></small></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Thai</b></td><td>\"I Must See the Snow Swan's Unseen Dream for Myself, She Thought\"</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Vietnamese</b></td><td><span lang=\"vi\">\"Nàng Muốn Thấy Giấc Mơ Thiên Nga Tuyết Chưa Từng Thấy\"</span></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>German</b></td><td><span lang=\"de\">„</span>Sie dachte: <span lang=\"de\">‚</span>Ich m<span lang=\"de\">ö</span>chte Zeugin des Traums werden, den die Schneeschw<span lang=\"de\">ä</span>nin nie gesehen hat.<span lang=\"de\">‘“</span></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Indonesian</b></td><td>\"I Must See the Snow Swan's Unseen Dream for Myself, She Thought\"</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Portuguese</b></td><td>\"Devo Ver o Sonho do Cisne da Neve, Pensou Ela\"</td><td>\"I Must See the Dream of the Snow Swan, She Thought\"</td></tr><tr><td><b>Turkish</b></td><td>\"Kar Ku<span lang=\"tr\">ğ</span>usunun G<span lang=\"tr\">ö</span>r<span lang=\"tr\">ü</span>lmeyen R<span lang=\"tr\">ü</span>yas<span lang=\"tr\">ı</span>n<span lang=\"tr\">ı</span> Bizzat G<span lang=\"tr\">ö</span>rmeliyim Diye D<span lang=\"tr\">üşü</span>nd<span lang=\"tr\">ü</span>\"</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Italian</b></td><td>\"'Devo ammirare il sogno invisibile del cigno delle nevi coi miei occhi', pens<span lang=\"it\">ò</span>\"</td><td>\"'I Must Admire the Invisible Dream of the Snow Swan With my Eyes', She Thought\"</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Change_History\">Change History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.co